{
  "case_id": "MEGAS-PRECISION-1.20.1",
  "title": "机械师立牌(megas)「精准打击」取证：消耗 6 张(>=阈值) 触发 => 次数 3、每命中 +1 层 => 层数 3 且伤害逐轮递进 (2+1)+(2+2)+(2+3)=12 => 靶 500->488；等待 5s 后复核层数与血量均不变（效果永久持续直到死亡，不随时间衰减、不重复结算）。",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "new",
    "ref": "megas_sign"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：机械师立牌(megas)「轨道轰炸 / 物资补充 / 精准打击」游戏内取证。\n本用例组由探针 megas* 系列驱动，**只调产品公开函数**（MegasSignItem / OrbitalBombardmentManager / PrecisionStrikeEffect / ModAttachments），断言锚定 latest.log 的 AP_<tag>_MEGAS 机器行。\n\n**期望值均按产品常量独立推算**（不读产品的中间量）：RADIUS=12、BASE_DAMAGE=2、MAX_STRIKES=10、\nPRECISION_THRESHOLD=6、COST_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER=1、STRIKE_INTERVAL=10t、FALL=8t、合计单轮约 18t；\n主动冷却 120s=2400t；被动间隔 1200t、阈值 6 张。\n  次数 strikes = min(floor(消耗卡牌数 / 2), 10)；\n  单轮伤害 = BASE(2) + 战斗牌费用总和 x1；若有「精准打击」则该轮再 + 当前层数；\n  总伤害 = strikes x per + (precision ? strikes x (strikes+1)/2 : 0)。\n\n**场景控制**：doMobSpawning false（仅本用例内，末尾恢复）避免自然刷怪混入目标池；\n探针读数里的 near（指定靶 12 格内存活实体数）恒应为 1 —— 若被污染则**响亮失败**，\n不把伤害平摊当成功。\n\nWARN 冷却写在 TargetSelectionAction#apply 内 => 只有 megascast confirm 档能验冷却；\nWARN 轰炸异步（每轮 10t 间隔 + 8t 下落）=> 伤害/层数必须在用例侧 wait 之后读。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..128]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "精准打击（触发/层数/伤害递进/永久）：6 张效果牌(>=6) => strikes=min(3,10)=3、per=2。\n  每轮先 +1 层再结算 => 三轮伤害 = (2+1)+(2+2)+(2+3) = 12 => 靶 500->488；层数 prec=3（= 被轰炸次数）。\n  随后再等 5s 复核：层数**不衰减**（永久持续直到死亡）且不再追加伤害 => dummy 仍 488、prec 仍 3。\n  WARN 层数是「该目标被轰炸次数」的累计，且每层使该目标受到的轨道轰炸伤害 +1 —— 两者由同一读数行交叉验证。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/give @s astral_dice:effect_card_hamburger 6",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasprep P0 500 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascd P1 fresh",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread P2 PRE",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascast P3 confirm",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread P3 AFTER",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread P4 PERSIST",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasclear ZZ9",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_P2_MEGAS:phase=PRE:[^\\n]*:hand=[6-9][0-9]*:cd_end=0:cd_rem=0:[^\\n]*:dummy=500/500:prec=0:"
    },
